\documentclass{report}
\title{Monsoon Onset Over the Western Ghats}
\author{K. Ramanathan}
\date{2026}
\begin{document}
\maketitle
\chapter{Large-Scale Drivers}
The coupling coefficient \alpha$ controls the strength of the land-sea thermal contrast.
When the contrast develops early in the season, the onset advances by roughly a week.
\chapter{Data}
We use gridded reanalysis fields at one degree resolution,
blended with coastal rain gauge observations.
\end{document}

